Annotations: |
  When developing and testing: follow the practice `convention`.
  The cell is the aggregation facade of the document validation rules:
  it re-exports every rule of the five rule zones as-is — the rules are
  declared and implemented in their zone cells, and this contract includes
  them unchanged via embedding. All re-exported rules are mutations of
  `DocumentRule`.

